# Placeholder config for slowapi's Limiter (kept intentionally empty and ASCII-only).
# Rate-limit params are passed explicitly in app/core/limiter.py (e.g. storage_uri="memory://").
# This file exists so slowapi's starlette.Config does NOT read the real .env, which on Windows
# would be opened with the system GBK codec and crash on UTF-8 (Chinese) comments.
